Negative control for the tickets single-read `with` set (FE-3206).

FE-3206 widened `ONE_WITH` to the full `contract_product.*` member set so the
single read supplies every relation the full `mapContractProduct` reads. Rule
home: the `@decision` block above `ONE_WITH` in `tickets.services.ts`.

The mutation drops `contract_product.status` from `ONE_WITH`, so the single
read no longer asks the API for the linked product's status. The guard
"sends exactly the widened ONE_WITH, full contract_product.* included" goes
RED, because the observed `with` set no longer equals the recorded set.
Spec: packages/headless/src/modules/tickets/__tests__/tickets.reads.int.test.ts

